2. Add these styles to your Global CSS
​Ensure your project has these styles in globals.css (or equivalent) to handle the 3D flipping logic:

@layer utilities {
  .perspective-1000 {
    perspective: 1000px;
  }
  .preserve-3d {
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
  }
  .backface-hidden {
    backface-visibility: hidden;
  }
}

